[
  {
    "nid": "description",
    "order": 1,
    "localTask": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "把一个对象说完整"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Describe one object fully"
      }
    ],
    "beats": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "beatNid": "opening",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "点出对象"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Name the object"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "先把要写的对象点出来：这是谁、是什么，或你眼前看到的是哪一件。读完这一句，别人就知道这段在写什么。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "First name what you are writing about: who it is, what it is, or what you see in front of you. After this sentence, a reader should know what this paragraph is about."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "beatNid": "develop",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "写样子特点"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Add how it looks"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "接着写它的样子、特点或常在做什么。用看得见、听得到的细节把这个对象立住，不要另起一个话题。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Then write how it looks, what it is like, or what it often does. Use details you can see or hear, and stay with this one thing."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "beatNid": "turn",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "举个例子"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Give an example"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "如果还要再写，就补一个具体的例子或一个特别的地方，让前面那些特点落到一件真事上。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "If you write more, add a concrete example or one special detail so the earlier points land on something real."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 4,
        "beatNid": "close",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "收一句感受"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "End with a feeling"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "可以收一句你的感受、喜好，或它为什么值得一写。不写也可以，别在这里突然换成别的东西。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "You may end with a feeling, a preference, or why it is worth writing about. You can skip this beat, but do not switch to something else."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "difficulty": {
      "min": 0,
      "max": 3
    },
    "name": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "描述"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Description"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "先说出要写的是谁或什么，再把它的样子和特点写清楚，最后可以补一句感受。"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "First name who or what you are writing about, then add how it looks or what it is like, and you may end with a feeling."
      }
    ],
    "system": true,
    "enabled": true
  },
  {
    "nid": "qa",
    "order": 2,
    "localTask": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "围绕一个核心问题作答并补细节"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Answer one question and add detail"
      }
    ],
    "beats": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "beatNid": "opening",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "先答问题"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Answer first"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "题目问什么，第一句就答什么。不要先铺垫、绕圈子；别人读完就应该听到那个答案。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Answer the question in the first sentence. Do not warm up or talk around it; a reader should hear the answer at once."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "beatNid": "develop",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "补相关细节"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Add related detail"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "再补上和这个答案直接有关的细节：谁、在哪、怎么样、为什么。补的内容要能撑住刚才那句回答。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Then add details that belong to that answer: who, where, how, or why. What you add should support the sentence you just wrote."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "beatNid": "turn",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "再补一个角度"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Add another angle"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "如果还要写，就换一个小角度再补一点，例如另一种情况或另一条相关信息，仍然围着同一个问题。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "If you write more, add one more angle — another case or one related fact — still about the same question."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 4,
        "beatNid": "close",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "把回答收住"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Close the answer"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "用一句把回答收住，让人觉得这个问题已经说完了。不要在收尾时再抛出新问题。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Close so the question feels finished. Do not open a new question at the end."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "difficulty": {
      "min": 0,
      "max": 2
    },
    "name": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "问答"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Question and Answer"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "先直接回答问题，再补上相关的细节。问题一般已经写在题目里。"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Answer the question first, then add a little more. The question is usually already in the prompt."
      }
    ],
    "system": true,
    "enabled": true
  },
  {
    "nid": "recount",
    "order": 3,
    "localTask": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "把一件发生过的事按顺序说完"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Tell what happened, in order"
      }
    ],
    "beats": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "beatNid": "opening",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "交代时间地点"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Set time and place"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "先交代那一次是在什么时候、什么地方，必要时点出有谁。让读者知道你要讲的是已经发生过的一件事。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "First say when and where that time was, and who was there if it matters. A reader should know you are telling something that already happened."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "beatNid": "develop",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "按顺序写经过"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Tell it in order"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "按发生的顺序把经过写下去：先怎样、后来怎样。一件事接一件事，不要跳到说明做法或发表观点。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Tell what happened in order: first this, then that. Stay with the events; do not switch into how-to steps or an opinion."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "beatNid": "turn",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "写意外转折"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Write the turn"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "如果有变化、意外或转折，就写在这里：事情跟预想不一样的那一下。没有的话这一拍可以空着。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "If something changed or went unexpected, write that shift here. If nothing turned, this beat may stay empty."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 4,
        "beatNid": "close",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "写结果感受"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "End with the result"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "写这件事的结果，或你当时的感受。收在「那一次」上，不要改口去讲以后常常怎么做。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "End with the result or how you felt that time. Stay with that one occasion; do not switch into how it is usually done."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "difficulty": {
      "min": 0,
      "max": 4
    },
    "name": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "经过"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "What Happened"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "写下那一次发生了什么：先交代时间和地点，再按顺序写经过，最后写结果或感受。"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Tell what happened that time: set the time and place, then write the events in order, and end with the result or how you felt."
      }
    ],
    "system": true,
    "enabled": true
  },
  {
    "nid": "process",
    "order": 4,
    "localTask": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "把一种做法或通用过程讲清楚"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Explain how something is done"
      }
    ],
    "beats": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "beatNid": "opening",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "先说怎么做"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Say what the steps are"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "先说清楚你要讲的是哪一件事怎么做，以及大概有几步。读者应该知道接下来是说明书，不是在讲某一次经历。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "First say what you are explaining how to do, and roughly how many steps there are. A reader should know this is a how-to, not one past event."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "beatNid": "develop",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "一步步写"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Write the steps"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "按步骤往下写：先做什么、再做什么。每一步都是通用做法，用顺序词带着走，别写成「有一天我……」。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Write the steps in order: first do this, then that. These are the usual steps, not a story that starts with “one day I…”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "beatNid": "turn",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "这一拍空着"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Leave this beat empty"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "过程段通常不在这里拐弯。这一拍空着，把步骤写在展开里就行。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "A process paragraph usually does not turn here. Leave this beat empty and keep the steps in the develop beat."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 4,
        "beatNid": "close",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "写做成之后"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Say what it is like done"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "写做成之后会怎样，或提醒最后要注意什么。让人感到这套步骤已经走完。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Say what it is like when it is done, or give a last reminder. The steps should feel finished."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "difficulty": {
      "min": 1,
      "max": 4
    },
    "name": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "过程"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "How to Do It"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "讲清楚一件事通常怎么做：先说要讲哪些步骤，再一步步写，最后写做成之后会怎样。"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Explain how something is usually done: say what the steps are, write them in order, and end with the result."
      }
    ],
    "system": true,
    "enabled": true
  },
  {
    "nid": "reason_example",
    "order": 5,
    "localTask": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "先立一点，再给原因，再用例子撑住"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "State a point, then reason, then example"
      }
    ],
    "beats": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "beatNid": "opening",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "先立那一点"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "State the point"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "先把你要说明的那一点写出来：你主张什么、或要解释哪一件事实。后面所有句子都围着这一点。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "First state the point you will explain: what you claim, or which fact you are accounting for. Everything after this stays on that point."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "beatNid": "develop",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "再说为什么"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Say why"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "接着说为什么：给出原因、根据或道理。这一拍是在撑住开头那一点，不是另起一个观点。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Then say why: give a reason or grounds. This beat supports the opening point; it is not a new claim."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "beatNid": "turn",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "落到例子上"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Land on an example"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "最好再落到一个具体例子上，让原因变得可看见。没有合适的例子时可以空着，但有例子会更稳。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "If you can, land on a concrete example so the reason can be seen. You may skip this beat, but an example makes it stronger."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 4,
        "beatNid": "close",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "把这一点收住"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Close on that point"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "用一句把这一点收住，让人回到开头那个判断。不要在收尾时换成另一个主张。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Close back on that same point. Do not switch to a different claim at the end."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "difficulty": {
      "min": 1,
      "max": 4
    },
    "name": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "原因和例子"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Reason and Example"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "先写出你要说明的那一点，再说为什么，最好再举一个例子。"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "First make your point, then say why, and add an example if you can."
      }
    ],
    "system": true,
    "enabled": true
  },
  {
    "nid": "comparison",
    "order": 6,
    "localTask": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "对照两个对象后落下判断"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Compare two sides and judge"
      }
    ],
    "beats": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "beatNid": "opening",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "先说比什么"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Say what you compare"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "先说要比的是哪两方、比什么。读完这一句，读者就知道后面是在对照，而不是只写其中一边。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "First say which two sides you are comparing, and on what. A reader should know this is a contrast, not a description of only one side."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "beatNid": "develop",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "写清楚一边"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Write one side"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "把其中一边写清楚：它什么样、有什么特点。先把这一边立住，再留给下一拍去写另一边。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Write one side clearly: what it is like. Set this side down before the next beat takes the other side."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "beatNid": "turn",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "再写另一边"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Write the other side"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "再写另一边，对准刚才比的那几件事来说。两边要对得上，才看得出异同。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Then write the other side, on the same points you just used. The two sides should line up so the difference can be seen."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 4,
        "beatNid": "close",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "落下判断"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Give your judgment"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "落下你的判断：更喜欢哪边、哪边更合适，或两边各自适合什么。不要只停在罗列差异。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Give your judgment: which side you prefer, which fits better, or what each side is for. Do not stop at listing differences."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "difficulty": {
      "min": 1,
      "max": 4
    },
    "name": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "比较"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Comparison"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "先说要比什么，再一边一边写清楚，最后说出你的判断。"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "First say what you are comparing, write one side and then the other, and finish with your judgment."
      }
    ],
    "system": true,
    "enabled": true
  },
  {
    "nid": "opinion",
    "order": 7,
    "localTask": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "先表态，再撑住，再收束"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "State a view, support it, and close"
      }
    ],
    "beats": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "beatNid": "opening",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "先说出看法"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "State your view"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "先把自己的看法说出来，态度要清楚。后面是在为这个看法辩护，不是先讲故事再猜你的立场。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "State your view first, clearly. What follows defends this view; do not tell a story and leave the stance to guesswork."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
