            "text": "用理由撑住刚才的看法：为什么你会这样想。一条理由写清楚，比空泛地重复观点更有用。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Support that view with a reason: why you think so. One clear reason is worth more than repeating the opinion."
          }
