  {
    "nid": "problem_solution",
    "order": 8,
    "localTask": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "提出问题并给出办法"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Name a problem and offer a solution"
      }
    ],
    "beats": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "beatNid": "opening",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "点出问题"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Name the problem"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "先把问题点出来：难在哪里、谁会碰到。让读者知道这段是在处理一个麻烦，不是在描写风景。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Name the problem first: what is hard, and who runs into it. A reader should know this paragraph is handling a trouble, not describing a scene."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "beatNid": "develop",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "说清情况"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Explain the situation"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "把现在的情况说清楚：这个问题带来什么影响、为什么值得管。为后面给办法做铺垫。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Explain the situation: what the problem does, and why it matters. This sets up the solution that follows."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "beatNid": "turn",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "给出办法"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Give a solution"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "给出办法：可以怎么做、谁来做。办法要能对上开头那个问题，不要另开一张清单。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Give a way to deal with it: what to do, and who does it. The solution must meet the problem you named, not start a new list."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 4,
        "beatNid": "close",
        "name": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "写结果建议"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "End with result or advice"
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "lang": "zh",
            "text": "写做成之后会怎样，或给一条建议、提醒。让人感到问题已经被接住了。"
          },
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "Say what happens if it works, or give one last piece of advice. The problem should feel taken up."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
